weight. He seems really miserable and unhappy and in pain and so on. But even after the doctors finally tell the Shah the truth in the summer of 1978, the US Embassy is still reporting to Washington there are rumors about the Shah's health and I quote, our sources indicate there's no doubt the Russians are spreading the stories to the best of our knowledge the Shah is fine.
体重。他看起来真的很痛苦、不快乐等等。但即使在1978年夏天医生最终告诉沙阿真相后，美国大使馆仍然向华盛顿报告说有关于沙阿健康的谣言，我引用一下，“我们的消息来源表明，毫无疑问是俄国人在散布这些故事，据我们所知，沙阿很好。”

137
01:06:56.000 --> 01:07:08.000
