the fact that there weren't barely anyone in the Bastille. Exactly. And so within days, people have poured onto the streets, hundreds of thousands of people across Iran, and they are shouting, the Shah is guilty, burn the Shah. I mean, the Shah had nothing to do with this. But from this point, I think there's no way back for him.
